+  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h2 style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>Summer Entertainment</strong></h2><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Come alive with the&nbsp;sounds of summer&nbsp;at&nbsp;The Pier at Garden&nbsp;City! Our beach&nbsp;deck bar hosts&nbsp;afternoon karaoke sessions&nbsp;where you&nbsp;can belt&nbsp;out your favorite tunes&nbsp;with the&nbsp;ocean breeze as your backdrop. As&nbsp;the sun sets, the&nbsp;energy shifts to&nbsp;live bands performing&nbsp;every night&nbsp;(weather permitting) at&nbsp;both ends of the pier. Whether&nbsp;you're jamming to classic rock or dancing to country classics our&nbsp;668-foot pier&nbsp;transforms into the Grand Strand's most unique&nbsp;music venue. Grab a&nbsp;cold drink, feel&nbsp;the salt air, and let the&nbsp;music move&nbsp;you. Find the latest band schedule on our <a href="https://www.facebook.com/PieratGardenCity" target="_blank">Facebook page</a>.</p></div>
