+
+			<p>Flooded docks on the sound side of Wrightsville Beach. Photo courtesy of Jackson Armstrong</p>
+			</td>
+			<td>
+			<p><a href="/images/ilm/climate/Ian/WrightsvilleBeachSurge.jpg"><img alt="" src="/images/ilm/climate/Ian/WrightsvilleBeachSurge.jpg" style="width: 360px; height: 480px;" /></a></p>
+
+			<p>Ian&#39;s storm surge pushed through public beach accesses at Wrightsville Beach.&nbsp; Photo courtesy of Jaime Armstrong.</p>
+			</td>
