+
+<p>&nbsp;</p>
+
+<p><span style="font-size:16px;"><strong>Elsewhere</strong></span></p>
+
+<p><span style="font-size:16px;">Power outages occurred as trees were blown down in scattered areas across many counties in interior southeastern North Carolina and northeastern South Carolina.&nbsp; </span></p>
+
+<p>&nbsp;</p>
+
+<p>&nbsp;</p>
