+      h.p(`The pier is the center of this side. Its café serves breakfast, its deck bar has karaoke on summer afternoons, and bands play every night at both ends of the pier, weather permitting. The arcade is there for a rainy day. A pier pass covers fishing, so no state fishing license is needed, and in summer you can fish around the clock.`) +
