+
+      partH3(P2, "docks and tidal creeks") +
+      h.p(`Behind the beach strip is salt marsh, cut by tidal creeks that reach the inlet at Garden City Point. The houses along its edges look out over the marsh, and many have a long private dock. On the beach strip they line Dogwood Drive. On the mainland side they are on streets like Creekside Drive and Rum Gully Road.`) +
+      photo(OBLIQUE) +
